  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, spicy moroccan spice blend, and salt.",
    "Add sliced kabanos to the marinade and let it sit for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread kabanos, zucchini, bell pepper, red onion, and carrots onto skewers.",
    "Brush skewers with olive oil and season with salt.",
    "Grill skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally, until kabanos is slightly charred.",
    "Serve hot with cherry tomatoes on the side."
